      "SubmissionTime": "2025-08-11T14:58:25.000+00:00",
      "ReviewText": "I have only used the once but used it for about 3 hours as our yard has a lot of bushes. Compared to a typical Black and Decker hand held electric corded unit, this was a game changer. It fit my Craftsman 2 stroke trimmer shaft fine. It freed me from be tied down with the cord and having to worry about cutting the cord with it! It had much more power and could cut through thicker branches. It gave me much more reach that most of the time was very useful but a couple of times made it tricky in tight spaces. It let me get to areas of my yard that are difficult to get to or impossible with a cord. It definitely saved time. It is heavier and a good workout. My arms have been sore for a couple of days after 3-4 hours of use. Overall super happy with it! I should made this upgrade years ago!",
      "Title": "Hedged like never before!",
      "UserNickname": "Darren",
