      "SubmissionId": "r10534_12__16301895uipa6ngHSc",
      "SubmissionTime": "2021-08-28T22:26:38.000+00:00",
      "ReviewText": "Was hesitant to order. Compatibility description was vague.  Compatible units not shown on photo as indicated.  Found it to be compatible with my battery operated Kobalt.\n\nAlso hesitant due to the long extension arm.  Length was not included in description.  More balanced than I expected with the long pole.  Was able to trim the whole top of hedge from one side.  Would have still liked to have a shorter pole for closer work.  Salvaged that piece off my old unit but swapping them will probably be too inconvenient.\n\nOffers more position settings than my old craftsman trimmer.\n\nCut the more ridged hedge branches smoothly, but struggled with more wispy weeds sticking up through.  Will be subject to a more rigorous evaluation when I take it out to trim back MTB trails.",
      "Title": "long reach",
      "UserNickname": "Tomg",
